      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -504,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Approval-gated contract and e-sign\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nA request builds the document from a template and the deal's pricing, then stops. A person approves it in Slack before anything is sent.\n\nOnce approved, an e-signature request goes out with a covering email. When it's signed, the deal is updated, the customer gets next steps and the team is told.\n\nA sweep every hour nudges stale approvals and escalates the ones nobody has answered.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
